  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nVenue and Room Hire:\n\nThe Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum is a fantastic venue in the middle of the historic Cotswolds town of Woodstock, Oxfordshire, nestled at the bottom of the beautiful walled garden of The Oxfordshire Museum, and on the doorstep of the historic Blenheim Palace.\n\nBeyond an exhibition space\n\nWhether it’s business networking, a regular meeting, or celebrating a special occasions, you'll find one of our spaces to suit your needs. In our bright, dynamic and modern spaces,  we've hosted everything from birthday parties, to wedding anniversaries and celebration of life services. Alongside exhibitions we've hosted craft fairs, book launches and training courses.\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum is a unique venue for a wide range of events and occasions. Ideal for meetings of any size, the Briefing Room can be expanded into our Main Hall through a partition wall, opening up a wider space to welcome bigger crowds at your next event.\n\nDownload a copy of this Venue Hire brochure here >>>\n\nAdditional Hire Services\nA member of our team on-hand to assist with your booking\nEvent listings in our newsletters and brochures (if applicable)\nA variety of in-house catering options, including tea, coffee and locally hand-made cakes\nKitchen and catering facilities for use alongside your booking\nA reduced entry fee for your guests/delegates into the galleries.\nAvailability\n\nOur regular availability times are:\n\nTuesday – Saturday: 9am-5pm\nSundays: 2pm-5pm\n\nFor booking outside of these hours, or bookings that require private hire of the entire venue during public opening times, additional fees may apply.\n\n \n\n \n\nKitchen Facilities & Catering\n\nIf you need catering services throughout your booking, we have 5* Hygiene-rated kitchen facilities on site, which can be hired alongside rooms for your own or your preferred caterer's use. Alternatively we have recommended caterers we have used for many of our own events.\n\nCatering Price Guide\n\nKitchen hire from £10\n\nCanapés from £15 per head\n\nSeated dinner £40 per head\n\nBuffet dinner from £35 per head\n\nPrices may vary depending on menu choices and do not include staffing.\n\nTo discuss your booking in more detail, or for any other enquiries, please contact us at fundraising@sofo.org.uk\n\nChildren’s Parties\n\nFind out more about our kids' party offer here.\n\n \n\n \n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum is a recommended venue for Spy:Co parties.\n\nFind out more about having your own spy-themed birthday party!\n\n \n\nEscape Room\nLooking for something truly unique?\n\nWe now ofter an escape room experience, perfect for parties, stag and hen groups, as well as corporate events and team building!\n\nAre you up to the challenge of Operation Spy Catcher? Crack clues and solve puzzles to identify the hidden identity of a double agent and excape occupied France in a unique Second World War-themed escape room experience.\n\nRoom and Venue Hire Enquiries\nYour Name\nYour Email\nHire Dates\nPreferred dates of hire\nAttendees\nEstimated number of attendees or group size\nMessage\nHow did you find out about us?\nHow did you find out about us?\nContact Us\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
